<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:operaton="http://operaton.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" id="Definitions_MaintenanceOrder" targetNamespace="https://virtual-factory.example/bpmn" exporter="Virtual Factory" exporterVersion="1.0">
<bpmn:process id="MaintenanceOrder" name="Maintenance order (predictive maintenance)" isExecutable="true" operaton:historyTimeToLive="P1D">
<bpmn:documentation>Maintenance order of a monitored component (predictive maintenance, ADR-0029): started by the maintenance service when the remaining useful life falls below the threshold. The planner chooses the maintenance window (next order boundary or immediately); the ERP keeps the line free (maintenance window), the line is stopped in the PackML unit mode Maintenance through the AAS (LineControl, ops gateway), the technician replaces the wear parts and completes the task (MES terminal or Tasklist), the part change is confirmed to the device through the line controller's Control Component, the line is handed back to production and the maintenance is recorded in the AAS (ConditionMonitoring, Reliability).</bpmn:documentation>
<bpmn:startEvent id="Start_Maintenance" name="Maintenance required"><bpmn:documentation>Started by the maintenance service (services/maintenance) when the predicted remaining useful life of a monitored component falls below the order threshold; variables component, componentName, device, maintenanceId, taskName, instructions, summary, resetParameter, healthIndexAtOpen, rulCyclesLow, rulHoursLow, cyclesAtOpen.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_1</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:startEvent><bpmn:userTask id="User_Plan" name="Plan maintenance: ${componentName}" operaton:candidateGroups="maintenance"><bpmn:documentation>${summary}</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:extensionElements><operaton:formData><operaton:formField id="immediate" label="Stop the running order now (otherwise at the next order boundary)" type="boolean" defaultValue="false" /><operaton:formField id="planner" label="Planned by" type="string" /></operaton:formData></bpmn:extensionElements><bpmn:incoming>Flow_1</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_2</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:userTask><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Reserve" name="Reserve maintenance window (ERP)" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-reserve"><bpmn:documentation>Requests a maintenance window from the ERP (capacity reservation): start at the next order boundary or immediately (planner's choice). The ERP releases no production order while the window is open.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_2</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_3</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_Wait"><bpmn:incoming>Flow_3</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:incoming>Flow_Wait</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_4</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:exclusiveGateway><bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="Timer_Wait" name="5 s"><bpmn:incoming>Flow_4</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_5</bpmn:outgoing><bpmn:timerEventDefinition id="Timer_Wait_def"><bpmn:timeDuration xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">PT5S</bpmn:timeDuration></bpmn:timerEventDefinition></bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_CheckLine" name="Check order boundary" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-check-line"><bpmn:documentation>Window active = the running order is finished (or Immediate): the line is free for the maintenance.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_5</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_6</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_Free" name="Line free?" default="Flow_Wait"><bpmn:incoming>Flow_6</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Free</bpmn:outgoing><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_Wait</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:exclusiveGateway><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_LineStop" name="Stop line, maintenance mode" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-line-stop"><bpmn:documentation>LINE01/LineControl ExecuteSkill(Maintain, Maintenance): stops the line if it runs and switches the PackML unit mode to Maintenance (no infeed, no auto start).</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_Free</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_7</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:userTask id="User_Execute" name="${taskName} (${component})" operaton:candidateGroups="maintenance"><bpmn:documentation>${instructions}</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:extensionElements><operaton:formData><operaton:formField id="technician" label="Technician" type="string" /><operaton:formField id="findings" label="Findings / actions" type="string" /><operaton:formField id="partsReplaced" label="Wear parts replaced" type="boolean" defaultValue="true" /></operaton:formData></bpmn:extensionElements><bpmn:incoming>Flow_7</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_8</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:userTask><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_DeviceReset" name="Confirm part change on the device" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-device-reset"><bpmn:documentation>ExecuteSkill(Maintain, Maintenance, {resetParameter: true}) - the line controller's Control Component sends the confirmation to the device (AID action); waits until the device reports its counters reset. Skipped if no parts were replaced.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_8</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_9</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Handback" name="Hand line back to production" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-line-handback"><bpmn:documentation>LineControl SetUnitMode(Production) and completion of the ERP window: the ERP releases the next order and the MES starts the line; an order interrupted by an immediate window is restarted (ExecuteSkill Produce).</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_9</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_10</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Record" name="Record maintenance in the AAS" operaton:type="external" operaton:topic="maintenance-record"><bpmn:documentation>MaintenanceRecord in the component's ConditionMonitoring submodel, observed field data in Reliability; the maintenance order and its advisory alarm are closed.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:incoming>Flow_10</bpmn:incoming><bpmn:outgoing>Flow_11</bpmn:outgoing></bpmn:serviceTask><bpmn:endEvent id="End_Maintenance" name="Maintenance completed"><bpmn:incoming>Flow_11</bpmn:incoming></bpmn:endEvent><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_1" sourceRef="Start_Maintenance" targetRef="User_Plan"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_2" sourceRef="User_Plan" targetRef="Task_Reserve"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_3" sourceRef="Task_Reserve" targetRef="Gw_Wait"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_4" sourceRef="Gw_Wait" targetRef="Timer_Wait"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_5" sourceRef="Timer_Wait" targetRef="Task_CheckLine"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_6" sourceRef="Task_CheckLine" targetRef="Gw_Free"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_Free" name="free" sourceRef="Gw_Free" targetRef="Task_LineStop"><bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">${lineFree}</bpmn:conditionExpression></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_Wait" name="wait" sourceRef="Gw_Free" targetRef="Gw_Wait"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_7" sourceRef="Task_LineStop" targetRef="User_Execute"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_8" sourceRef="User_Execute" targetRef="Task_DeviceReset"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_9" sourceRef="Task_DeviceReset" targetRef="Task_Handback"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_10" sourceRef="Task_Handback" targetRef="Task_Record"></bpmn:sequenceFlow><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_11" sourceRef="Task_Record" targetRef="End_Maintenance"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
</bpmn:process>
<bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_MaintenanceOrder"><bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_MaintenanceOrder" bpmnElement="MaintenanceOrder">
<bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_Maintenance_di" bpmnElement="Start_Maintenance"><dc:Bounds x="150" y="182" width="36" height="36" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="130" y="222" width="76" height="27" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="User_Plan_di" bpmnElement="User_Plan"><dc:Bounds x="230" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Reserve_di" bpmnElement="Task_Reserve"><dc:Bounds x="390" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_Wait_di" bpmnElement="Gw_Wait" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="550" y="175" width="50" height="50" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Timer_Wait_di" bpmnElement="Timer_Wait"><dc:Bounds x="640" y="182" width="36" height="36" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="620" y="222" width="76" height="27" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_CheckLine_di" bpmnElement="Task_CheckLine"><dc:Bounds x="720" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_Free_di" bpmnElement="Gw_Free" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="880" y="175" width="50" height="50" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="860" y="229" width="90" height="27" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_LineStop_di" bpmnElement="Task_LineStop"><dc:Bounds x="980" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="User_Execute_di" bpmnElement="User_Execute"><dc:Bounds x="1140" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_DeviceReset_di" bpmnElement="Task_DeviceReset"><dc:Bounds x="1300" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Handback_di" bpmnElement="Task_Handback"><dc:Bounds x="1460" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Record_di" bpmnElement="Task_Record"><dc:Bounds x="1620" y="160" width="110" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_Maintenance_di" bpmnElement="End_Maintenance"><dc:Bounds x="1780" y="182" width="36" height="36" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1760" y="222" width="76" height="27" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_1"><di:waypoint x="186" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="230" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_2"><di:waypoint x="340" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="390" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_3"><di:waypoint x="500" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="550" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_4"><di:waypoint x="600" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="640" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_5"><di:waypoint x="676" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="720" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_6"><di:waypoint x="830" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="880" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_Free_di" bpmnElement="Flow_Free"><di:waypoint x="930" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="980" y="200" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="936" y="182" width="40" height="14" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_Wait_di" bpmnElement="Flow_Wait"><di:waypoint x="905" y="175" /><di:waypoint x="905" y="120" /><di:waypoint x="575" y="120" /><di:waypoint x="575" y="175" /><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="911" y="157" width="40" height="14" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_7"><di:waypoint x="1090" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="1140" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_8"><di:waypoint x="1250" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="1300" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_9_di" bpmnElement="Flow_9"><di:waypoint x="1410" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="1460" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_10_di" bpmnElement="Flow_10"><di:waypoint x="1570" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="1620" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge><bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_11_di" bpmnElement="Flow_11"><di:waypoint x="1730" y="200" /><di:waypoint x="1780" y="200" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
</bpmndi:BPMNPlane></bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
